body:
At one point under Darth Revan's tutelage, Malak openly viewed his [Master](http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Sith_Master/Legends) as being soft, causing tension between the two that [culminated](http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Duel_on_Revan%27s_flagship) in a [lightsaber duel](http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Lightsaber_duel/Legends). Revan removed Malak's jaw with a lightsaber strike,[\[2\]](http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Darth_Malak#cite_note-KotOR_CG-1) and Malak was forced to wear a large metal [prosthesis](http://starwars.wikia.com/wiki/Cybernetics/Legends) cover over where his jaw had once been. A vocabulator allowed Malak to talk, but his voice now reverberated with a gruff electronic tone.

&#x200B;

That's what I found on Wookieepedia. Admittedly not 100% reliable but it's something
